{"step_index":107,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-06T08:06:28Z","thinking":"**Designing Frontend UI Components**\n\nFrontend UI component design can commence concurrently with the background task. Focusing on the navbar, the design includes a top banner with promotional messaging. The navbar header features a logo, \"Cake N Flowers,\" with subtext describing the business.\n\n\n**Defining UI Component Hierarchy**\n\nAnalyzing the component structure, the design focuses on key modules: navigation, product display, cart management, and product customization. Distinct components include navbar with navigation links and user actions, footer with business information, product cards with customization triggers, a cart drawer for item management, and a modal for detailed product customization.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"import React, { useState } from 'react';\\nimport { Link, useNavigate } from 'react-router-dom';\\nimport { ShoppingBag, Search, User, Sparkles, Clock, Menu, X, ShieldCheck } from 'lucide-react';\\nimport { useCart } from '../../context/CartContext';\\nimport { useAuth } from '../../context/AuthContext';\\n\\nexport default function Navbar({ onOpenAuthModal }) {\\n  const { itemCount, setIsCartOpen } = useCart();\\n  const { user, logout, isAdmin } = useAuth();\\n  const [mobileMenuOpen, setMobileMenuOpen] = useState(false);\\n  const [searchOpen, setSearchOpen] = useState(false);\\n  const [searchQuery, setSearchQuery] = useState('');\\n  const navigate = useNavigate();\\n\\n  const handleSearchSubmit = (e) => {\\n    e.preventDefault();\\n    if (searchQuery.trim()) {\\n      navigate(`/catalog?search=${encodeURIComponent(searchQuery.trim())}`);\\n      setSearchOpen(false);\\n      setSearchQuery('');\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <header className=\\\"sticky top-0 z-40 bg-boutique-cream/95 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-boutique-border/60 transition-all\\\">\\n      {/* Editorial Announcement Bar */}\\n      <div className=\\\"bg-boutique-forest text-boutique-goldLight text-xs py-2 px-4 text-center font-medium tracking-wide flex items-center justify-center gap-2\\\">\\n        <Sparkles className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-boutique-gold animate-pulse\\\" />\\n        <span>Complimentary temperature-controlled delivery on orders over $70. Use code <strong className=\\\"text-boutique-gold underline decoration-dotted\\\">WELCOME10</strong> for 10% off.</span>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between h-20\\\">\\n          {/* Mobile Menu Button */}\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center lg:hidden\\\">\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setMobileMenuOpen(!mobileMenuOpen)}\\n              className=\\\"text-boutique-forest p-2 hover:text-boutique-gold transition\\\"\\n              aria-label=\\\"Toggle menu\\\"\\n            >\\n              {mobi\n<truncated 8926 bytes>","Description":"\"Create luxury editorial Navbar component\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\karth\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\cake-n-flowers\\\\frontend\\\\src\\\\components\\\\layout\\\\Navbar.jsx\"","toolAction":"\"Writing Navbar component\"","toolSummary":"\"Navbar component\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
