{"step_index":111,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-06T08:06:49Z","thinking":"**Designing the ProductCard Component**\n\nThe ProductCard component needs to display an editorial image with zoom functionality, a star rating and review count, and an eggless badge based on a property. Also, it should include a customizable tag and a price, potentially indicating a starting variant. Finally, a button to trigger `onSelect(product)` is necessary for either customisation or quick ordering.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"import React from 'react';\\nimport { Link } from 'react-router-dom';\\nimport { Star, Sparkles, Heart } from 'lucide-react';\\n\\nexport default function ProductCard({ product, onCustomize }) {\\n  const primaryImage = Array.isArray(product.images) && product.images.length > 0\\n    ? product.images[0]\\n    : 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1578985545062-69928b1d9587?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80';\\n\\n  const secondaryImage = Array.isArray(product.images) && product.images.length > 1\\n    ? product.images[1]\\n    : primaryImage;\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"group relative bg-white rounded-2xl border border-boutique-border/70 overflow-hidden shadow-boutique hover:shadow-boutique-hover transition-all duration-500 flex flex-col\\\">\\n      {/* Image Container with Hover Reveal */}\\n      <div className=\\\"relative aspect-square w-full overflow-hidden bg-boutique-paper\\\">\\n        <Link to={`/product/${product.slug}`} className=\\\"block w-full h-full\\\">\\n          <img\\n            src={primaryImage}\\n            alt={product.name}\\n            loading=\\\"lazy\\\"\\n            className=\\\"w-full h-full object-cover object-center group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700 ease-out\\\"\\n          />\\n        </Link>\\n\\n        {/* Badges Overlay */}\\n        <div className=\\\"absolute top-3 left-3 flex flex-col gap-1.5 z-10\\\">\\n          {product.isEggless && (\\n            <span className=\\\"bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm text-boutique-sage text-[10px] uppercase font-bold tracking-wider px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full shadow-sm border border-boutique-sage/20\\\">\\n              🌿 100% Eggless\\n            </span>\\n          )}\\n          {product.isCustomizable && (\\n            <span className=\\\"bg-boutique-forest/90 backdrop-blur-sm text-boutique-gold text-[10px] uppercase font-bold tracking-wider px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full shadow-sm\\\">\\n              ✨ Customizable\\n            </span>\\n          )}\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Wishlist Heart */}\\n        <button\\n          className=\\\"absolute top-3 right-3 w-\n<truncated 2438 bytes>","Description":"\"Create ProductCard component with editorial photo hover and tags\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\karth\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\cake-n-flowers\\\\frontend\\\\src\\\\components\\\\product\\\\ProductCard.jsx\"","toolAction":"\"Writing ProductCard component\"","toolSummary":"\"ProductCard component\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
