{"step_index":115,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-06T08:07:08Z","thinking":"**Constructing the Cart Drawer Component**\n\nThe plan is to create the `CartDrawer` component, implementing a slide-in side drawer. It will display a list of cart items, each detailing customizations like flavor, weight, eggless status, inscription, custom message, and a photo. Additionally, the component needs quantity controls and a trash button per item, a summary of the delivery slot selection (with a same-day cutoff badge), and a coupon code form with inline validation, finishing with a pricing summary showing subtotal and delivery fee (with a free condition).\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"import React, { useState } from 'react';\\nimport { Link, useNavigate } from 'react-router-dom';\\nimport { X, Trash2, Plus, Minus, ArrowRight, Tag, Sparkles, Clock, ShieldCheck } from 'lucide-react';\\nimport { useCart } from '../../context/CartContext';\\n\\nexport default function CartDrawer() {\\n  const {\\n    items,\\n    removeFromCart,\\n    updateQuantity,\\n    isCartOpen,\\n    setIsCartOpen,\\n    coupon,\\n    applyCoupon,\\n    removeCoupon,\\n    discountAmount,\\n    deliveryFee,\\n    subtotal,\\n    total,\\n    deliverySlot,\\n    setDeliverySlot,\\n    deliveryDate,\\n    setDeliveryDate\\n  } = useCart();\\n\\n  const [couponCode, setCouponCode] = useState('');\\n  const [couponError, setCouponError] = useState('');\\n  const [couponLoading, setCouponLoading] = useState(false);\\n  const navigate = useNavigate();\\n\\n  if (!isCartOpen) return null;\\n\\n  const handleApplyCoupon = async (e) => {\\n    e.preventDefault();\\n    if (!couponCode.trim()) return;\\n    setCouponError('');\\n    setCouponLoading(true);\\n    try {\\n      await applyCoupon(couponCode.trim());\\n      setCouponCode('');\\n    } catch (err) {\\n      setCouponError(err.message || 'Invalid coupon code');\\n    } finally {\\n      setCouponLoading(false);\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleCheckoutClick = () => {\\n    setIsCartOpen(false);\\n    navigate('/checkout');\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"fixed inset-0 z-50 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n      {/* Backdrop */}\\n      <div\\n        className=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-boutique-forest/50 backdrop-blur-xs transition-opacity duration-300\\\"\\n        onClick={() => setIsCartOpen(false)}\\n      />\\n\\n      <div className=\\\"fixed inset-y-0 right-0 max-w-full flex pl-10\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"w-screen max-w-md bg-boutique-cream shadow-2xl flex flex-col border-l border-boutique-border\\\">\\n          {/* Header */}\\n          <div className=\\\"p-6 border-b border-boutique-border/60 flex items-center justify-between bg-white\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-bold tracki\n<truncated 10374 bytes>","Description":"\"Create CartDrawer component with slide animation and summary\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\karth\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\cake-n-flowers\\\\frontend\\\\src\\\\components\\\\cart\\\\CartDrawer.jsx\"","toolAction":"\"Writing CartDrawer component\"","toolSummary":"\"CartDrawer component\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
