{"step_index":119,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-06T08:07:27Z","thinking":"**Defining Homepage Components**\n\nThe homepage requires a clear structure. A hero section will feature editorial imagery and brand messaging with a call to action. An occasion selector facilitates product discovery, followed by category cards and featured bestsellers with customization options.\n\n\n**Mapping Out App Component Structure**\n\nNeed to define the core building blocks of the application, starting with key differentiating factors and authentic feedback points for the brand. Next is the catalog page with filtering and sorting features, and then the product detail page with customization.\n\nFollowing the product flow, the checkout page requires a streamlined process for customer details, delivery selection (including special 'Midnight Surprise' slots), and secure payment options, including a sandbox for testing. The final confirmation page integrates order tracking.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"import React, { useState, useEffect } from 'react';\\nimport { Link, useNavigate } from 'react-router-dom';\\nimport { Sparkles, ArrowRight, Star, Clock, ShieldCheck, Heart, Truck, Gift } from 'lucide-react';\\nimport { api } from '../api/client';\\nimport ProductCard from '../components/product/ProductCard';\\nimport CustomizerModal from '../components/product/CustomizerModal';\\n\\nconst OCCASIONS = [\\n  { id: 'birthday', label: 'Birthday Jubilees', image: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1535141192574-5d4897c13136?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80', description: 'Celebratory tiers and vibrant blooms' },\\n  { id: 'anniversary', label: 'Anniversary Milestones', image: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1561181286-d3fee7d55364?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80', description: 'Crimson Ecuadorian roses & rich truffles' },\\n  { id: 'romance', label: 'Love & Romance', image: 'https://images.unsplash.com